    "info": "Run the simulator first, then deploy this flow. Default reads:\n- Unit ID 1, FC3 holding registers, address 0, quantity 3\n- Unit ID 2, FC4 input registers, address 0, quantity 1\n\nSimulator scale is 100, so raw 1234 means 12.34 A.",
